<h1>Changelog</h1>
<p>All notable changes to this project are documented here. The format is
based on <em>Keep a Changelog</em>, and versions follow semantic versioning.</p>
<h2>Unreleased</h2>
<h3>Added</h3>
<ul>
<li><code>kt toml check</code> validates TOML 1.0 files and reports the line of the
first error.</li>
<li><code>kt grep</code> learned <code>--count</code> and <code>--files-with-matches</code>.</li>
</ul>
<h3>Fixed</h3>
<ul>
<li>Archives larger than 4 GB are no longer truncated (#212).</li>
<li><code>kt rotate</code> keeps the file mode of the log it rotates.</li>
</ul>
<h2>1.4.0 - 2026-09-30</h2>
<h3>Changed</h3>
<ul>
<li>The default compression level is now 6, not 9. Level 9 was <strong>twice as
slow</strong> for a gain of under 1%.</li>
<li><code>--quiet</code> is now <code>-q</code>; the old spelling still works.</li>
</ul>
<h3>Removed</h3>
<ul>
<li>The <code>kt legacy</code> command, deprecated since 1.1.</li>
</ul>
<hr />
<p>Older releases are listed in <a href="HISTORY.md">HISTORY</a>.</p>
